      "examples": [
        {
          "exampleId": "w:view#e-660db25e070df9b4",
          "text": "I climbed to the top of a small rise and realised that the mist was little more than a few feet deep, and though it was only a short climb, I found myself completely above it and looking at a wonderfully clear view of Skiddaw with the sun setting in the west.",
          "source": {
