          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:view#e-286e7944ea60f63f",
          "text": "From a 21st-century point of view, the printed book is certainly ancient, but it remains as interactive as any battery-powered e-reader.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2023-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2023年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试英语（新课标Ⅱ卷）",
